#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:2
msgid "Cluster Updates"
msgstr "Cluster Updates"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:7
msgid ""
"Cluster Updates allow administrators to apply software updates, patches, and"
" configuration changes to cluster nodes in a controlled manner. The update "
"workflow orchestrates rolling updates across cluster members to minimize "
"downtime and ensure cluster stability throughout the process."
msgstr ""
"Clúster Actualiza permitir administrators a apply software actualiza, "
"patches, y configuración cambios a cluster nodos en un controlled manner. El"
" update workflow orchestrates rolling actualiza a través de cluster miembros"
" a minimize downtime y asegurar cluster stability throughout el proceso."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:9
msgid ""
"Cluster updates are supported for Kubernetes clusters, MVM clusters, and "
"Docker clusters managed by |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"Clúster actualiza son soportados para Kubernetes clusters, MVM clusters, y "
"Docker clusters administrado por |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:12
msgid "Update Workflow"
msgstr "Update Workflow"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:14
msgid "The cluster update process follows a managed workflow:"
msgstr "El cluster update proceso follows un administrado workflow:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Preparation** — |morpheus| evaluates the cluster state and determines "
"which nodes need updates."
msgstr ""
"**Preparation** — |morpheus| evaluates el cluster estado y determines cual "
"nodos necesita actualiza."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Cordon** — Worker nodes are cordoned (marked as unschedulable) to prevent "
"new workloads from being placed on them."
msgstr ""
"**Cordon** — Worker nodos son cordoned (marked como unschedulable) a prevent"
" nuevo cargas de trabajo desde being placed en them."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Drain** — Existing workloads are gracefully evicted from the node being "
"updated."
msgstr ""
"**Drain** — Existente cargas de trabajo son gracefully evicted desde el nodo"
" being actualizado."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Update** — The update is applied to the node (OS patches, Kubernetes "
"version upgrade, package updates, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"**Update** — El update es applied al nodo (OS patches, Kubernetes versión "
"actualización, package actualiza, etc.)."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:20
msgid "**Verify** — The node's health is verified after the update."
msgstr "**Verify** — El nodo's health es verified después de el update."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Uncordon** — The node is uncordoned and made available for scheduling "
"again."
msgstr ""
"**Uncordon** — El nodo es uncordoned y made disponible para scheduling "
"again."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:22
msgid "**Next Node** — The process repeats for the next node in the cluster."
msgstr ""
"**Next Node** — El proceso repeats para el siguiente nodo en el cluster."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:24
msgid ""
"This rolling approach ensures that the cluster maintains availability "
"throughout the update process."
msgstr ""
"Este rolling approach ensures ese el cluster maintains disponibilidad "
"throughout el update proceso."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:27
msgid "Executing a Cluster Update"
msgstr "Executing un Clúster Update"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:29
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Clusters``"
msgstr "Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Clusters``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:30
msgid "Click the name of the Cluster to update"
msgstr "Click el nombre del Clúster a update"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:31
msgid "Click :guilabel:`ACTIONS`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`ACCIONES`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:32
msgid "Select **Update**"
msgstr "Seleccionar **Update**"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:33
msgid "Review the update details:"
msgstr "Review el update details:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:40
msgid "UPDATE TYPE"
msgstr "UPDATE TYPE"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:36
msgid "The type of update to apply:"
msgstr "El tipo de update a apply:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Kubernetes Version** — Upgrade Kubernetes components to a new version"
msgstr ""
"**Kubernetes Version** — Actualización Kubernetes components a un nuevo "
"versión"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:39
msgid "**OS Patches** — Apply operating system security patches and updates"
msgstr "**OS Patches** — Apply sistema operativo security patches y actualiza"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:40
msgid "**Package Update** — Update installed addon packages"
msgstr "**Package Update** — Update instalado addon packages"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:42
msgid "TARGET VERSION"
msgstr "TARGET VERSION"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:43
msgid "The target version to update to (for version upgrades)."
msgstr "El destino versión a update a (para versión actualizaciones)."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:49
msgid "NODES"
msgstr "NODES"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:45
msgid "Select which nodes to include in the update. Options:"
msgstr "Seleccionar cual nodos a incluir en el update. Opciones:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:47
msgid "**All Nodes** — Update all cluster members (rolling)"
msgstr "**All Nodes** — Update todos cluster miembros (rolling)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:48
msgid "**Workers Only** — Update only worker nodes"
msgstr "**Workers Only** — Update solo nodos worker"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:49
msgid "**Specific Nodes** — Select individual nodes to update"
msgstr "**Specific Nodes** — Seleccionar individual nodos a update"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:51
msgid "Click :guilabel:`EXECUTE`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`EXECUTE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:54
msgid "Monitoring Update Progress"
msgstr "Monitoring Update Progress"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:56
msgid "Update progress can be monitored from the cluster's **History** tab:"
msgstr ""
"Update progress puede be monitored desde el cluster's **History** pestaña:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:58
msgid "Each node update appears as a separate history entry"
msgstr "Cada nodo update aparece como un separate historial entrada"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:59
msgid "Status indicators show: Queued, Running, Complete, or Failed"
msgstr "Estado indicators mostrar: Queued, Ejecutando, Completo, o Falló"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:60
msgid "Detailed logs are available by clicking on individual history entries"
msgstr ""
"Detailed registros están disponibles por clicking en individual historial "
"entradas"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:63
msgid "Update Status Values"
msgstr "Update Estado Valores"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:65
msgid "**Queued** — Update is scheduled but not yet started"
msgstr "**Queued** — Update es scheduled pero no aún iniciado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:66
msgid "**Running** — Update is actively being applied to a node"
msgstr "**Running** — Update es actively being applied a un nodo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:67
msgid "**Complete** — Update finished successfully"
msgstr "**Complete** — Update finished successfully"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:68
msgid ""
"**Failed** — Update encountered an error (manual intervention may be "
"required)"
msgstr ""
"**Falló** — Update encountered un error (manual intervention puede ser "
"requerido)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:69
msgid "**Cancelled** — Update was cancelled by an administrator"
msgstr "**Cancelled** — Update fue cancelled por un administrator"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:71
msgid ""
"If a node update fails, the rolling update process pauses to allow "
"investigation. The remaining nodes are not updated until the failure is "
"resolved or the update is manually resumed."
msgstr ""
"Si un nodo update falla, el rolling update proceso pauses a permitir "
"investigation. El remaining nodos son no actualizado hasta el fallo es "
"resolved o el update es manualmente resumed."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:74
msgid "Best Practices"
msgstr "Best Practices"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:76
msgid ""
"**Test in non-production first** — Apply updates to development or staging "
"clusters before production."
msgstr ""
"**Test in non-production first** — Apply actualiza a development o staging "
"clusters antes de production."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:77
msgid ""
"**Review release notes** — Check for breaking changes in the target version "
"before upgrading."
msgstr ""
"**Review release notes** — Verificar para breaking cambios en el destino "
"versión antes de upgrading."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:78
msgid ""
"**Ensure backup** — Take a cluster backup or snapshot before applying major "
"updates."
msgstr ""
"**Ensure backup** — Take un cluster backup o snapshot antes de applying "
"major actualiza."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:79
msgid ""
"**Monitor capacity** — Ensure the cluster has sufficient capacity to handle "
"workloads during the rolling update (when nodes are temporarily "
"unavailable)."
msgstr ""
"**Monitor capacidad** — Asegurar el cluster tiene sufficient capacidad a "
"handle cargas de trabajo durante el rolling update (cuando nodos son "
"temporarily unavailable)."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:80
msgid ""
"**Schedule maintenance windows** — For production clusters, schedule updates"
" during low-traffic periods."
msgstr ""
"**Schedule mantenimiento windows** — Para production clusters, schedule "
"actualiza durante bajo-traffic periods."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/cluster_updates.rst:82
msgid ""
"Cluster updates cannot be easily rolled back. Ensure you have a recovery "
"plan (such as cluster backups or the ability to rebuild nodes) before "
"applying updates."
msgstr ""
"Clúster actualiza cannot be easily rolled back. Asegurar you tienen un "
"recuperación plan (como cluster backups o el ability a rebuild nodos) antes "
"de applying actualiza."
